 "The launcher reports an error": "启动器报告错误",
 "The main light is soft ambient light (VaM's ambient spherical harmonics and ambient specular); the lamps only shape, rim and colour the background. All of it is placed around the person, from where you look: it follows the person walking, and the light moves over the body as the person turns; the window's and the sun's directions stay fixed in the world.\nStopping puts the scene's own lights and ambient back; changing the scene stops it by itself.": "主光是柔和的环境光（VaM 的环境球谐和环境高光），灯只做塑形、轮廓和背景色光。都围绕人物、按你看过去的方向摆放：人物走动时跟着走，转身时光在身上流动；窗边和太阳的方向固定在世界里。\n停止后恢复原灯光和环境；切换场景自动停止。",
 "The mod: skin and hair shading, upscaling (DLSS, XeSS or FSR), neural rendering and frame generation; path tracing is switched in the in-game menu. Vanilla: loads none of the mod's files; for going back and for comparing.": "增强画面 mod：皮肤和头发着色、超分（DLSS / XeSS / FSR）、神经渲染和插帧，路径追踪在游戏内菜单里开关。原版：不加载任何 mod 文件，只用来回退和对照。",
