 "VR Graphics": "VR 画面",
 "VaM Hair Budget\n\nPuts a ceiling on what simulated hair costs to draw (per person and for the whole scene). Above it, only the most expensive hair comes down to a common level; cheaper hair and small pieces stay as they are.\n\nOnly the values the renderer and the physics read change: the hair sliders, the scene and the preset files keep their own values, and saves are not affected.\n\nCost = patches × hm × (cd + 25) × 24/49 segments (25 more per strand)\nSettings are saved to BepInEx\\config\\VaMHairBudget.ini as you change them": "VaM 头发预算\n\n给物理头发的渲染开销设上限（每个人物、整个场景）。超出时只把最贵的头发降到同一水位，较便宜的头发和小件不动。\n\n只改实际渲染与物理读取的数值：头发滑块、场景和预设文件里仍是原值，存档不受影响。\n\n开销 = 面片 × hm × (cd + 25) × 24/49 段（每根发丝另算 25 段）\n设置自动保存到 BepInEx\\config\\VaMHairBudget.ini",
